## Reconciliation request

```json
{
  "version": 1,
  "kind": "request",
  "projects": [
    {
      "name": "demo",
      "target": "fixture@0.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "leads": [
    {
      "source": "code",
      "lead": "login-flow",
      "synopsis": "signIn(email, password) handler in the auth module.",
      "topics": [
        "auth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "code",
      "lead": "session-timeout",
      "synopsis": "Session TTL constant in the session store.",
      "topics": [
        "auth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "docs",
      "lead": "login-flow",
      "synopsis": "Users sign in with an email address and password.",
      "topics": [
        "auth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "docs",
      "lead": "session-timeout",
      "synopsis": "Documented session expiry policy.",
      "topics": [
        "auth"
      ]
    },
    {
      "source": "docs",
      "lead": "password-reset",
      "synopsis": "A password reset flow is mentioned but never specified.",
      "topics": [
        "auth"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

## Plan context

- plan: auth
- sources:
  - code: adapter `fixture-code`, value "The code source."
  - docs: adapter `fixture-docs`, value "The docs source."
